      "message": "This sounds like we\u0027re only calling prepareInternal() for its side effect of stopping the runners, and that therefore stopping them should be done by a method called here and in prepareInternal. If we need to call prepareInternal also for other reasons then the comment needs to be amended.\n\nBut also, the only call here is in startVpnProfile immediately after we called prepare(), which calls prepareInternal if it succeeds (or is unnecessary in which case prepareInternal() should be a no-op), so why do we need to do this again ?",
