      "writtenOn": "2020-01-31T06:23:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not feeling strongly but I kind of think we should not be adding new states to this old API. The \"reason\" field has been deprecated into oblivion, and the only states that make any kind of sense now are CONNECTING, CONNECTED and DISCONNECTED, so newly passing FAILED is probably not great.\n\nI suggest you just say updateState(DISCONNECTED, null /* deprecated */)",
